Surviving Sid is a animation, comedy, tv movie film directed by Karen Disher.

2
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:58,500
Sid the Sloth takes a school of children out on a camping trip from home, only to find that in typical Sid
style, he is not a very good guide and the children he takes with him don't have a very good time.

3
