9
00:03:56,250 --> 00:04:02,250
Surviving Sid is a 2008 animated short film from Blue Sky Studios, starring
Sid the Sloth of Ice Age and a cameo appearance by Scrat.

10
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:28,500
It is the third in the series of Ice Age short films, the
other two being Gone Nutty and No Time for Nuts.

11
00:04:48,750 --> 00:04:54,750
Unlike the first two Ice Age short films, Surviving Sid focuses on
Sid and a small animal group of camping children.

12
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
Directed by Galen Tan Chu and Karen Disher, the short premiered
on December 9, 2008, on the Horton Hears a Who!

13
